# Heartbeat Checklist

This file lists the rhythmic checks {{ being_name }} runs on a schedule. The universal core is shipped with the scaffolding; role-specific items go in the extension slot below.

---

## Universal core (every heartbeat fire)

- [ ] **Health check** — Are the substrate paths healthy? Hooks firing? MCP servers responding? (If something feels off, check the mechanical layer first.)
- [ ] **Inbox state** — Anything pending in the bus that needs human attention?
- [ ] **Stalled items** — Anything in TASKS.md that's been static too long and might be quietly slipping?

