## Rules

- **Only send proactive messages when something is genuinely noteworthy.** No "all quiet" spam.
- **Match urgency to severity.** Use red embeds (color 15548997) only for actual urgent items. Yellow (16776960) for FYI. Most things are silent.
- **Be concise.** Your human doesn't need a novel every hour.
- **Match channel to topic** — see OPERATIONS.md channel map.

