## Scheduled routines (universal, shipped with scaffolding)

| Job | Schedule | Purpose |
|-----|----------|---------|
| Heartbeat | Hourly during waking hours | Run this checklist |
| Nightly reflection | 3:00 AM daily | Summarize raw logs into daily summaries |
| Vault lint | Wed + Sun 3:30 AM | Health check for stale files, contradictions, orphans |
| GitHub backup | 4:00 AM daily | Push vault to remote git (if configured) |
| Auth health probe | 3:30 AM daily | Verify external auth tokens still working |
| Service liveness probe | Every 4 hours | Verify substrate (bus, endpoints, daemon log) |

